bees);
 company, guild (of artisans etc.).

श्रेणी f. line, row, range, troop, multitude, swarm (of
bees);
 company, guild (of artisans etc.).

श्रे॑यंस् (compar.) fairer, more beautiful or excellent,
better than (न, esp. श्रेयस्—न better or rather-than);
distinguished, excellent;
 dear, beloved;
 auspicious, fortunate. n. the
better or good, i.e. (greater) welfare or prosperity.

श्रे॑ष्ठ (superl.) the fairest, most excellent or best of
(gen., loc., or —˚), best in or with regard to (loc. or —˚);
 better
than (abl. or gen.);
